<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Engage.Label>攻击目标</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Engage.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Engage.Desc>命令{0}攻击所选目标。{0}将按照指派的战斗方针接近并攻击目标，途中遭到攻击时会先反击来袭之敌。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Engage.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Engage.CurrentOrders>当前命令：{0}。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Engage.CurrentOrders>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Patrol.Label>巡逻：{0}</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Patrol.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Patrol.Desc>命令{0}在所选区域内巡逻，遇到进入射程的敌人便停下作战。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Patrol.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Patrol.NoneOption>不巡逻</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Patrol.NoneOption>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PatrolAssigned>{0}：正在巡逻{1}。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PatrolAssigned>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PatrolCleared>{0}：已取消巡逻。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PatrolCleared>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SeekDestroy.Label>搜索歼灭</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SeekDestroy.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SeekDestroy.Desc>{0}将主动追击敌人，而不是坚守位置。已标记和已下令的目标优先。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SeekDestroy.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PickerLabel>战斗方针：{0}</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PickerLabel>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PickerDesc>{0}作战所遵循的战斗方针。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PickerDesc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntAnimals.Label>猎杀动物</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntAnimals.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntAnimals.Desc>{0}在被征召期间猎杀野生动物。敌人始终优先。{0}的狩猎方针决定可猎杀哪些动物。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntAnimals.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastAll.Label>自动施放全部能力</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastAll.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastAll.Desc>将{0}的全部能力标记为被征召时自动施放。也可在每个能力自己的菜单中单独标记或取消标记。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastAll.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Pause.Label>暂停战斗自动驾驶</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Pause.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Pause.Desc>停止{0}的全部自动战斗行为，交还完全控制权。方针和命令都会保留，但在取消勾选之前不会执行。下达新的进攻或巡逻命令也会恢复运作。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Pause.Desc>

  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.TakeCover.Label>寻找掩体</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.TakeCover.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.TakeCover.Desc>远程角色转移到有掩体的射击位置。近战角色忽略此项。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.TakeCover.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.MeleeCharge.Label>近战冲锋</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.MeleeCharge.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.MeleeCharge.Desc>近战角色会冲向远处目标。关闭时，只攻击靠近的敌人。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.MeleeCharge.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PursueAnywhere.Label>全图追击</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PursueAnywhere.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PursueAnywhere.Desc>搜索歼灭从全地图选取目标，并且无论目标逃多远都会追击。关闭时只选取附近可见的敌人。搜索歼灭关闭时此项无效。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PursueAnywhere.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FightAsSquad.Label>小队作战</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FightAsSquad.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FightAsSquad.Desc>与附近同样启用小队作战策略的已征召角色协同：将火力分散到敌群，而不是全员围攻同一目标；彼此保持一格间距，让流弹和爆炸只波及一人而非一群。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FightAsSquad.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.BashDoors.Label>破门</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.BashDoors.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.BashDoors.Desc>破坏挡在通向目标路上的上锁或敌方房门。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.BashDoors.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.KeepDistance.Label>保持距离</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.KeepDistance.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.KeepDistance.Desc>远程角色在近战敌人过于接近时后撤。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.KeepDistance.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FallBackInjured.Label>重伤时后撤</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FallBackInjured.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FallBackInjured.Desc>重伤时先撤离逼近的敌人，随后依托掩体在远距离谨慎作战，而不是继续冲锋。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.FallBackInjured.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AvoidBlasts.Label>躲避爆炸</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AvoidBlasts.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AvoidBlasts.Desc>远离已点燃的爆炸物和即将到来的爆炸。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AvoidBlasts.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastMarked.Label>自动施放已标记的能力</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastMarked.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastMarked.Desc>施放角色已标记为自动施放的能力。标记决定施放哪些，此项决定是否施放。关闭时标记会保留但被忽略。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastMarked.Desc>

  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastOption>自动施放</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastOption>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastOn>自动施放已开启</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AutocastOn>

  <RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.EnableCombatAutopilot.Label>启用战斗自动驾驶</RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.EnableCombatAutopilot.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.EnableCombatAutopilot.Desc>允许被征召的角色自行作战。为被征召角色添加战斗方针、狩猎方针和新按钮。关闭后移除这些按钮并停止自动化。</RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.EnableCombatAutopilot.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.UndraftClearsStandingOrders.Label>解除征召时关闭搜索歼灭和猎杀动物</RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.UndraftClearsStandingOrders.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.UndraftClearsStandingOrders.Desc>角色被解除征召时，取消勾选搜索歼灭和猎杀动物。</RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.UndraftClearsStandingOrders.Desc>

  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyTitle>战斗方针</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyTitle>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyTip>创建并管理决定被征召角色如何自行作战的模板。在分配、动物或机械体标签页中分配方针；载具保留战斗方针按钮。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyTip>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyName>战斗方针</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyName>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.ManagePolicies>管理战斗方针</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.ManagePolicies>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.None>无</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.None>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.None.Tip>无战斗方针。该角色的战斗自动化完全关闭：不会搜索歼灭、不接受进攻命令、不自动施放能力。猎杀动物与巡逻是独立功能，仍然有效。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.None.Tip>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyInUse>战斗方针正被{0}使用。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.PolicyInUse>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.FullControl>完全自主</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.FullControl>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.FightNearby>就近作战</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.FightNearby>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.StaySafe>保全自身</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Policy.StaySafe>

  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyTitle>狩猎方针</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyTitle>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyTip>创建并管理决定被征召角色可猎杀哪些动物的模板：允许的物种列表、报复几率范围和受尊崇动物保护。狩猎本身由每个角色的“猎杀动物”按钮开启。角色被征召期间，这些规则优先于狩猎标记。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyTip>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyName>狩猎方针</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyName>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.ManageHuntPolicies>管理狩猎方针</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.ManageHuntPolicies>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyInUse>狩猎方针正被{0}使用。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyInUse>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyIsDefault>默认狩猎方针无法删除。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyIsDefault>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicy.SafeGame>安全猎物</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicy.SafeGame>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicy.AnyAnimal>任何动物</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicy.AnyAnimal>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyAnimalsRegion>允许的动物</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntPolicyAnimalsRegion>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntRevengeRange.Desc>只有“受伤报复几率”落在此范围内的动物才可猎杀。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntRevengeRange.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntRevengeRange.SliderLabel>受伤报复几率: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntRevengeRange.SliderLabel>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntSpareVenerated.Label>放过受尊崇的动物</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntSpareVenerated.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntSpareVenerated.Desc>绝不猎杀角色思潮所尊崇的动物。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.HuntSpareVenerated.Desc>

  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SummaryPrefix>启用：{0}。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SummaryPrefix>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SummarySeparator>、</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SummarySeparator>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SummaryNothing>不启用任何行为。角色坚守阵地并自由射击。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.SummaryNothing>

