  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.VehicleFiringPosition>正驶向射击阵位。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.VehicleFiringPosition>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.VehicleHolding>正在坚守射击阵位。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.VehicleHolding>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.EngagingOrdered>正在奉命攻击{0}。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.EngagingOrdered>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.EngagingMarked>正在攻击已标记目标{0}。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.Report.EngagingMarked>
