  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.EngageOption>攻击{0}</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.EngageOption>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.EngageOption.Tip>攻击该目标直至其倒下。途中来袭的敌人会先被击退。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.EngageOption.Tip>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.EngagePawnCount>{0}名角色</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.EngagePawnCount>
