  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.ClearOrders>撤销攻击命令</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.ClearOrders>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.OrdersCleared>攻击命令已撤销。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.OrdersCleared>

  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AttackDesignator.Label>标记攻击</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AttackDesignator.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AttackDesignator.Desc>标记搜索歼灭角色优先攻击的目标。区域扫选只标记敌对目标；Shift加入无派系生物，Ctrl加Shift加入所有人。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AttackDesignator.Desc>
  <RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AttackDesignator.MustTarget>必须标记可攻击的角色。</RimWorldAccess.Autopilot.AttackDesignator.MustTarget>
